    "program_description": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-[#475569]\"><p class=\"text-base font-normal leading-relaxed text-[#51617c]\">The <strong>Kathmandu Metropolitan City (KMC) Scholarship Program</strong> (popularly known as the <em>Balen Scholarship</em>) provides 100% free +2 education covering tuition, lab, library, and registration fees at top institutional (private) schools within Kathmandu. For the 2083/2084 (2026) academic session, KMC allocated 4,624 scholarship seats across 390 private schools.</p><div class=\"bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-inner\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-500\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M11 3.055A9.001 9.001 0 1020.945 13H11V3.055z\" /><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M20.488 9H15V3.512A9.025 9.025 0 0120.488 9z\" /></svg>Seat Distribution by Stream</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 pl-1\"><li class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Management</strong> <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs\">2,493 seats</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Science</strong> <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs\">1,752 seats</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Humanities</strong> <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs\">173 seats</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Law</strong> <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs\">136 seats</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Education</strong> <span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs\">70 seats</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-gray-100/60 border border-gray-200/70 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\" /></svg>Documents Required</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>SEE admit card</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>SEE mark sheet</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>Recent passport-sized photograph</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>Character certificate</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>Citizenship certificate or Birth registration certificate</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>Recommendation letter</li></ul></div><p class=\"text-sm pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[#51617c]\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\" /></svg><strong>Official Link:</strong> <a href=\"https://kathmandu.gov.np/?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium hover:underline\">Kathmandu Metropolitan City Portal</a></p></div>",
