    "program_description": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-[#475569]\"><p class=\"text-base font-normal leading-relaxed text-[#51617c]\">The <strong>Ullens Excellence Award</strong> is a prestigious, 100% full-tuition scholarship program run by the Ullens School in Nepal. Established in 2018, it supports academically high-achieving but economically underprivileged Secondary Education Examination (SEE) graduates.</p><div class=\"bg-blue-50/60 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-5\"><p class=\"text-sm text-blue-900 leading-relaxed m-0\">The program provides full funding for two pathways: the local <strong>National Examinations Board (NEB) Grade 11 &amp; 12 curriculum</strong>, and the international <strong>International Baccalaureate Diploma Programme (IBDP)</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-inner\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-500\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2\" /></svg>Application Requirements</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4\">To apply when admissions open annually (usually around Jestha/May):</p><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 block\">Academic Proof</strong><span class=\"text-gray-600\">Verified SEE board examination results meeting the GPA threshold.</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 block\">Financial Documentation</strong><span class=\"text-gray-600\">Official proof of economically disadvantaged or low-income status.</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 block\">Personal Statement</strong><span class=\"text-gray-600\">Essays detailing why you want to study at Ullens School, why you deserve funding, and how you plan to give back to your community.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 m-0\">Submissions can be emailed directly to <a href=\"mailto:excellenceaward@ullens.edu.np\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium underline\">excellenceaward@ullens.edu.np</a>.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2\"><a href=\"https://ullens.edu.np/admissions/ullens-excellence-award/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-100 transition-colors\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\" /></svg>Ullens Official Site</a><a href=\"https://edusanjal.com/scholarship/ullens-excellence-award/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\" /></svg>Edusanjal Details</a></div></div></div>",
