    "program_description": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-[#475569]\"><p class=\"text-base font-normal leading-relaxed text-[#51617c]\"><strong>UWC Nepal</strong> operates as the local branch and national committee of the global United World Colleges movement, dedicated to selecting exceptional Nepali students for the two-year International Baccalaureate Diploma Programme (IBDP) across 18 campuses worldwide. Over 80% of selected students receive partial or full financial aid.</p><div class=\"bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-inner\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-indigo-500\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" /></svg>Eligibility Criteria</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 block\">Academic Standing</strong><span class=\"text-gray-600\">Minimum GPA of 3.0 (75%) for private school graduates or 2.8 (70%) for government school graduates in Class 10 (SEE).</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 block\">Age &amp; Citizenship</strong><span class=\"text-gray-600\">Must hold official citizenship of Nepal and fit the designated age window for the cycle.</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 block\">Core Values</strong><span class=\"text-gray-600\">Demonstrated commitment to environmental sustainability, cross-cultural appreciation, and community service.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-2xl p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-indigo-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\" /></svg>Application Timeline</h3><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-xs font-medium\"><li class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100/80 text-indigo-900\"><span class=\"text-indigo-500 block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\">Online Application</span>Sep 21 – Oct 31</li><li class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100/80 text-indigo-900\"><span class=\"text-indigo-500 block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\">Selection Activities</span>November</li><li class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100/80 text-indigo-900\"><span class=\"text-indigo-500 block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\">Interviews</span>Nov – Dec</li><li class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100/80 text-indigo-900\"><span class=\"text-indigo-500 block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\">Final Decision</span>Late December</li></ul></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 m-0\"><strong>Alternate Pathway:</strong> Non-scholarship full-fee-paying candidates can apply via the <em>UWC Global Selection Programme (GSP)</em> until late August.</p><p class=\"text-sm pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[#51617c]\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\" /></svg><strong>Official Link:</strong> <a href=\"https://np.uwc.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium hover:underline\">UWC Nepal Official Website</a></p></div>",
