    "program_description": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-[#475569]\"><p class=\"text-base font-normal leading-relaxed text-[#51617c]\">The <strong>Mahatma Gandhi Scholarship Scheme (MGSS)</strong> is a merit-cum-means scholarship offered by the Embassy of India in Kathmandu to support Nepalese students completing their Plus Two (+2) education in Nepal.</p><div class=\"bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-2xl p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" /></svg>Financial Grant</h3><p class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-900 m-0\">NPR 24,000 <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-amber-700\">/ year for 2 years (Grades 11 &amp; 12)</span></p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-inner\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" /></svg>Key Eligibility Rules</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500 font-bold\">✓</span> <span><strong>Citizenship:</strong> Must be an official citizen of Nepal.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500 font-bold\">✓</span> <span><strong>Class 10 Merit:</strong> Minimum 60% aggregate marks in Class 10 (SEE).</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500 font-bold\">✓</span> <span><strong>Family Income:</strong> Total annual income under NPR 200,000.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500 font-bold\">✓</span> <span><strong>Age Limit:</strong> 17 to 22 years old as of July 1 of the application year.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-gray-100/60 border border-gray-200/70 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\" /></svg>Required Documents</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">• Class 11 enrollment proof &amp; principal attestation letter.</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">• Class 10 (SEE) mark sheet.</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">• Citizenship certificates of self, father, and mother.</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">• Official Nepal Government income certificate.</li></ul></div><p class=\"text-sm pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[#51617c]\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\" /></svg><strong>Official Link:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.indembkathmandu.gov.in/mgss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium hover:underline\">Embassy of India MGSS Portal</a></p></div>",
