    "program_description": "<div class=\"space-y-6 text-[#475569]\"><p class=\"text-base font-normal leading-relaxed text-[#51617c]\">The <strong>Sanima Bank Scholarship Scheme</strong> targets underprivileged, deserving SEE graduates who studied in community schools outside the Kathmandu Valley for Plus Two (+2) studies.</p><div class=\"bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/70 rounded-2xl p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" /></svg>Coverage &amp; Monthly Allowance</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs font-semibold\"><div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100 text-emerald-900\"><span class=\"text-emerald-600 block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\">100% Tuition</span>Covered for Grades 11 &amp; 12</div><div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100 text-emerald-900\"><span class=\"text-emerald-600 block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\">Monthly Stipend</span>NPR 2,000 / month + Books</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-inner\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253\" /></svg>Eligibility Rules</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-blue-500 font-bold\">•</span> SEE passed on <strong>first attempt</strong> with minimum 'B' grade.</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-blue-500 font-bold\">•</span> Minimum <strong>3 consecutive years</strong> in local government/community school.</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-blue-500 font-bold\">•</span> Resident of a district outside Kathmandu Valley where Sanima Bank operates.</li></ul></div><p class=\"text-sm pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[#51617c]\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\" /></svg><strong>Official Link:</strong> <a href=\"https://edusanjal.com/scholarship/sanima-bank-publishes-scholarship-notice-plus-two-students/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium hover:underline\">Sanima Bank Scholarship Notice</a></p></div>",
